        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the Open Design Docs website (the "Site"). Please read these Terms carefully, and contact us if you have any questions. By accessing or using the Site, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Using Open Design Docs</h2>
      <p>
        You may use our Site only if you can form a binding contract with Open Design Docs, and only in compliance with these Terms and all applicable laws. When you create your Open Design Docs account, you must provide accurate information. You are responsible for safeguarding your account, so please use a strong password and limit its use to this account. We cannot and will not be liable for any loss or damage arising from your failure to comply with the above.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Your Content</h2>
      <p>
        Any content you post to the Site will be viewable by others. You retain ownership of all content you post, but you grant us a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, modify, reproduce, and display your content in connection with the Site and our business.
      </p>
